/StructParent 30
/Contents (The problem formulation in this project is rooted in the high volume of dailydigital financial news reporting, which makes it difficult for stakeholders tomanually monitor shifts in public perception regarding economic policies. Thismanual monitoring has proven to have strategic weaknesses, as it is highlyvulnerable to human bias and frequently obscures positive achievements dueto elevated regulatory noise stemming from massive news frequencies.)
>>
endobj
