/Contents (To address these challenges, this problem is formulated into a natural languageprocessing \(NLP\) machine learning task: automated sentiment classificationusing the Support Vector Machine \(SVM\) algorithm. Through an end-to-endsystem integrated into a real-time web application, this model is designed tocut through information clutter by delivering objective, consistent, and data-driven sentiment analysis of Indonesian financial news.)
>>
endobj
