234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (To address this, Support Vector Machine \(SVM\) was selected due to its exceptional capability in handling the high-dimensional sparse matrices generated by TF-IDF. Instead of analyzing words independently, SVM operates mathematically by determining an optimal hyperplane to distinctly separate the sentiment classes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Following optimization via GridSearchCV with the hyperparameter parameter C=1, the SVM model successfully mitigated the baseline's limitations, significantly boosting performance to reach an accuracy of 93.48% and an F1-Score of 0.9353.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
