/P 567 0 R
/E (Frontend: The interactive user interface is developed using React.js powered by Vite to deliver a responsive and flexible Bring Your Own Device \(BYOD\) user experience, deployed separately on the Vercel platform.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
