252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (Data communication between these two independent architectures runs securely and asynchronously via the HTTPS protocol, enabling real-time financial news sentiment analysis without burdening the computing performance on the user's end.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
