<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Link
/P 517 0 R
/Alt (This dataset features a perfectly balanced dataset structure, with 1,100 rowsallocated to each of the Positive, Neutral, and Negative classes, utilizing theprimary textual features from the 'Judul' \(Title\) column. This balanced distributionwas consistently maintained across all experimental stages using a stratifiedsplitting method with an 80% training and 20% testing data split to prevent classbias during model validation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [217 0 R 626 0 R 627 0 R 628 0 R 629 0 R 630 0 R 631 0 R]
>>
