517 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 173 0 R
/E (This dataset features a perfectly balanced dataset structure, with 1,100 rows allocated to each of the Positive, Neutral, and Negative classes, utilizing the primary textual features from the 'Judul' \(Title\) column. This balanced distribution was consistently maintained across all experimental stages using a stratified splitting method with an 80% training and 20% testing data split to prevent class bias during model validation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [330 0 R]
>>
endobj
